    "n_chat_ia": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "maxH": 620,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Chat changes the Android home: a bottom bar with Chats · Calls · Contacts. Chats opens by default. Calls = the old Home's Recent list; Contacts = the contact list with the Add contact FAB. The availability pill and Settings stay in the top bar on every tab.\n\nTicks are honest: one tick = saved on your phone; two = their phone has it; clock = waiting until you are both online. No 'online' dots in lists: Tinline only knows someone is reachable while it is connected to them.",
